---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout'
import TitlePage from '@/components/TitlePage'
---

<BaseLayout
	title='Privacy Policy'
	description='Swift Published privacy policy — what we collect, how it is used, and how to reach us.'
>
	<TitlePage title='Privacy Policy' />

	<div class='prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none mt-8'>
		<p>
			We at <a href='https://swiftpublished.in'>swiftpublished.in</a> take user privacy seriously. So
			we collect as little data as possible, and it is mostly non-identifiable.
		</p>
		<p>
			This page covers every detail about the data we collect and why with full transparency. If you
			still have questions, please email us at{' '}
			<a href='mailto:hello@swiftpublished.in'>hello@swiftpublished.in</a>.
		</p>

		<h2>What we collect</h2>
		<p>
			The site itself does not collect any personal data. There is no login, and no user accounts.
		</p>
		<p>
			We use <strong>Google Analytics 4</strong> to measure page views and average reading time, so we
			know which articles are useful to readers. From the best of our knowledge it tracks:
		</p>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<strong>Device info:</strong> device model, OS, browser
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Session info:</strong> region, anonymous session identifier
			</li>
		</ul>
		<p>
			We highly encourage you to read the{' '}
			<a href='https://policies.google.com/privacy'>Google privacy policy</a> and the{' '}
			<a
				href='https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/6004245?sjid=15405696968975769090-AP#info_for_visitors'
			>
				Analytics visitor help section
			</a>{' '}
			because they apply alongside this policy.
		</p>

		<h2>How we use data</h2>
		<p>
			Aggregate Google Analytics data is used to understand which articles resonate with readers and
			to improve the site over time. We never sell, trade, or otherwise share your data with third
			parties. We do not send unsolicited newsletters or promotional emails.
		</p>

		<h2>What we never do</h2>
		<p>
			There is intentionally no login on Swift Published — you come here to learn, and you should be
			able to stay anonymous while doing it.
		</p>

		<hr />

		<p>
			Privacy policy last updated <strong>October 16, 2023</strong>. We may update it from time to
			time; please check back occasionally. Questions or feedback?{' '}
			<a href='mailto:hello@swiftpublished.in'>hello@swiftpublished.in</a>.
		</p>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>
